{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "A Song of Steel and Spirits",
    "steam_appid": 3647680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/95aa9fd1f276d4859d1b89d636ecea64.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Song of Steel &amp; Spirits</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG set in a pixelated realm where swords are sharp, magic is unstable, and alcoholic spirits are abundant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a crew of mercenaries, misfits, and magically inebriated wizards in an attempt to escape the dungeon and uncover the mystery of how they ended up there in the first place. Plot your moves across tight grid-based maps, combining strategic positioning, class synergies, and perfectly timed strikes to survive brutal dungeon encounters, monster ambushes, and the occasional bar brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Fast Turn-Based Combat </strong>\u2013 Master a grid-based combat system that is easy to learn and difficult to master, with positional strategy, environmental hazards, and enemy champions with unique abilities and quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2a98aae3f4febd463d093417dd3bbb9a.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2a98aae3f4febd463d093417dd3bbb9a.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2a98aae3f4febd463d093417dd3bbb9a.mp4?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Party-Based RPG</strong> \u2013 Level up your heroes and unlock new abilities that add endless possibilities of team-ups. Expect tactical challenges that will test your mettle, that only all your party members working together can solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2549086395f96f6b93da35a82f28302f.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/8c66b79efec64982d19e5fc695ea82ef.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b <strong>Timed Strikes &amp; Momentum</strong> \u2013 Master abilities and block enemy attacks by activating your action button at the precise moment in the animation for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.mp4?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect strikes contribute towards your character's <strong>momentum</strong>. Maxing out your momentum grants your hero a bonus action that triggers immediately in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your momentum for the perfect window of opportunity, perhaps during a boss fight when you need it most to deliver the killing blow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Satirical Fantasy World</strong> \u2013 Explore a land of brooding necromancers, belly-dancing snake-charmers, and bureaucracy-obsessed goblins while you fight your way to the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Pixel-Perfect Nostalgia</strong> \u2013 Classic 16-bit inspired visuals with expressive sprites, quirky animations, and lovingly handcrafted maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7b <strong>Tavern Tales</strong> \u2013 Recruit new party members and uncover mysteries, lore, and perhaps even the recipe to the perfect draft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/44a5b6c48ad62f70df3068e99bd48b08.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/f10c142f0a00bfc2be755f455e8a4bac.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/f10c142f0a00bfc2be755f455e8a4bac.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Jule</strong>: <i>&quot;I really should lay off the experimental ale.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/926769b156a4b9fed8b0b0778d7ee80f.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/926769b156a4b9fed8b0b0778d7ee80f.apng?t=1748629920\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><strong>Farryn</strong>: <i>&quot;<strong>Somebody</strong> needs to stay sober and be the designated ranger.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/a14b0cbf099f9098ed3758847c92fd34.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/a14b0cbf099f9098ed3758847c92fd34.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Duward</strong>: <i>&quot;Like a fine wine I only get better with time; I did not intend for that to rhyme.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/ef6f5b6c47f43772cda1a8afa8567b91.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/ef6f5b6c47f43772cda1a8afa8567b91.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Feng</strong>: <i>&quot;If there is greater meaning in life than stealing from the rich, I have yet to obtain it.&quot;</i>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/c8a160ddc1532de4f420e3aa16f9baa7.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/c8a160ddc1532de4f420e3aa16f9baa7.apng?t=1748629920\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><strong>Mr. Purreach</strong>: <i>&quot;Being a devout cleric of the Church of Nepeta Cataria precludes me from indulging in such frivolities. But doesn't mean I can't watch.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/bdd3d49b663e33306c58acb9ba9f11bf.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong>Stol</strong>: <i>&quot;For long I've had nothing but spirits for company. Its a welcome change to have ones of the living variety.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2aee084117072f47399552692e8ce572.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/963911af2ddf934575546215cf5d4b98.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/963911af2ddf934575546215cf5d4b98.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Lord Raze</strong> wants YOU to join the undead army. Will you answer the call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/255492bddca7add9cc3a929c2b1e9a01.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/255492bddca7add9cc3a929c2b1e9a01.apng?t=1748629920\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><strong>Lady</strong> <strong>Moltraine</strong>: <i>&quot;You look nutritious-ss. You'll make a fine meal for my pets-ss.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/f8c01a9cea7133480f49ecb0dc5180d7.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=128 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/f8c01a9cea7133480f49ecb0dc5180d7.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Gromp</strong>: <i>&quot;Nobody bosses around my goblins. 'cept me, of course.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
