el up your heroes and unlock new abilities that add endless possibilities of team-ups. Expect tactical challenges that will test your mettle, that only all your party members working together can solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/2549086395f96f6b93da35a82f28302f.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/8c66b79efec64982d19e5fc695ea82ef.avif?t=1748629920\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b <strong>Timed Strikes &amp; Momentum</strong> \u2013 Master abilities and block enemy attacks by activating your action button at the precise moment in the animation for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.poster.avif?t=1748629920\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.webm?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/78cc9e8c88c848c4cdb3a9c0c72e95d9.mp4?t=1748629920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect strikes contribute towards your character's <strong>momentum</strong>. Maxing out your momentum grants your hero a bonus action that triggers immediately in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your momentum for the perfect window of opportunity, perhaps during a boss fight when you need it most to deliver the killing blow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\